WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.467 --> 00:00:11.704
Danny woke up.

2
00:00:11.705 --> 00:00:16.008
He looked at the clock, turned over, and went back to sleep.

3
00:00:16.009 --> 00:00:22.829
The alarm woke him up again, but still he didn't get out of bed.

4
00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:26.583
Danny's mother saw her son still asleep in bed.

5
00:00:26.584 --> 00:00:28.783
She shook him by the shoulders.

6
00:00:28.784 --> 00:00:35.367
"Come on, Danny. It's time to get ready for school."

7
00:00:35.368 --> 00:00:37.177
"I don't want to go!

8
00:00:37.178 --> 00:00:42.094
I can't stand the thought of school!"

9
00:00:42.095 --> 00:00:44.119
Danny's mother frowned.

10
00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:49.545
"Now, Danny. I know, and you know, you must go to school.

11
00:00:49.546 --> 00:00:52.656
I'm tired of telling you to get up every day.

12
00:00:52.657 --> 00:00:55.869
So, get up!"

13
00:00:55.870 --> 00:00:59.183
Finally, Danny got up very slowly.

14
00:00:59.184 --> 00:01:02.663
He got ready for school very slowly.

15
00:01:02.664 --> 00:01:06.684
Danny even ate his breakfast very slowly.

16
00:01:06.685 --> 00:01:12.491
He chewed each piece of food for almost a minute.

17
00:01:12.492 --> 00:01:15.659
Danny's mother was getting very angry.

18
00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:18.142
She spoke again to her son,

19
00:01:18.143 --> 00:01:19.989
"Look at the time!

20
00:01:19.990 --> 00:01:21.780
You'll be late, Danny.

21
00:01:21.781 --> 00:01:23.278
Finish your breakfast.

22
00:01:23.279 --> 00:01:27.645
You must go to school!"

23
00:01:27.646 --> 00:01:30.827
Danny looked at his mother and shook his head.

24
00:01:30.828 --> 00:01:33.167
"I don't want to go to school.

25
00:01:33.168 --> 00:01:35.129
I don't care if I am late.

26
00:01:35.130 --> 00:01:40.052
I never want to go to school again!"

27
00:01:40.053 --> 00:01:43.392
Danny's mother folded her arms across her chest.

28
00:01:43.393 --> 00:01:45.719
She looked sternly at her son.

29
00:01:45.720 --> 00:01:53.656
"Danny, you know as well as I do: you must go to school."

30
00:01:53.657 --> 00:01:56.151
Danny looked up at his mother angrily.

31
00:01:56.152 --> 00:02:01.893
"Give me two good reasons why I should go to school."

32
00:02:01.894 --> 00:02:05.856
Danny's mother rolled her eyes and then looked at her son.

33
00:02:05.857 --> 00:02:09.865
"First, you are 45 years old.

34
00:02:09.866 --> 00:02:15.805
And second, you are the principal of the school."

35
00:02:15.806 --> 00:02:17.729
Danny glared at his mother.

36
00:02:17.730 --> 00:02:19.722
He pushed his breakfast away.

37
00:02:19.723 --> 00:02:21.500
He picked up his briefcase.

38
00:02:21.501 --> 00:02:27.061
And he slammed the door as he left for school.
